From: MontaraGroup <304200332+MontaraGroup@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:51:00 -0400
Subject: feat: allow setting space icons with standard icons in addition to emojis

Expands EditSpaceView to offer a curated palette of clean standard symbol
icons (star, flag, heart, bolt, triangle, home, briefcase, gear, compass, mail,
pen, command, terminal, search, chat, shield, music, coffee, globe, etc.) alongside
emojis:
- Adds StandardIconChoices() with 36 clean vector symbol glyphs.
- Builds both "Icons" and "Emoji" selection palettes in EditSpaceView's icon tab.
- Updates icon textfield placeholder from "Type or paste any emoji" to
  "Type or paste an icon or emoji".
- Highlights chosen standard icon in Refresh() and updates live previews.
- Adds PressStandardIconForTesting and browser test coverage in edit_space_browsertest.cc.

Why: the owner asked for Space icons to be selectable with normal icons,
not just emojis.
Removable when: never as a feature; only if Space icon customization is redesigned.
